<title>JAPAN: Romanian central bank launches 5.05 pct samurais.</title>
<headline>Romanian central bank launches 5.05 pct samurais.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Romanian central bank on Wednesday launched 30 billion yen worth of 5.05 percent five-year samurai bonds, priced at par, lead manager Nomura Securities said.</p>
<p>The bonds will mature on October 9, 2001, with biannual coupon payments.  </p>
<p>The breakdown of the terms is as follows:</p>
<p>AMT 30 bln yen COUPON 5.05 pct  MATURITY Oct 9, 2001</p>
<p> TYPE samurai   ISS PRICE 100    PAY DATE Oct 9, 1996</p>
<p>SUB PERIOD Sept 25 to Oct 8</p>
<p>INTEREST PAYMENT April 9 and Oct 9</p>
<p>SIGN DATE Sept 20 (planned)</p>
<p>LAST RATING  BB+(JCR), BB-(S&amp;P), Ba3(Moody's)</p>
<p>LEAD MANAGER Nomura Securities</p>
<p>LEAD TRUSTEE N/A</p>
</text>
